{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026CXXTIVxnhI1792982612.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>「一帶一路」綠色創新大會首次於本港舉行。<br/></p><p>大會由環境及生態局、國家生態環境部合辦。行政長官李家超、國家生態環境部部長黃潤秋、外交部駐港特派員崔健春、環境及生態局局長謝展寰等出席。<br/></p><p>今屆主題為攜手南方綠色轉型，共促全球可持續發展。逾四百位香港、內地及「一帶一路」國家官員和專家，將探討如何透過創新、合作等，促進可持續發展與低碳轉型進程，並在綠色技術、裝備等方面交流，推動大灣區綠色發展。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:25.300366+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":192,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T02:40:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T04:40:19.353757+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:47.861518+00:00","content_hash":"010ac32f6835e1098a0c0b1062c65bd29435aeade192f284de968a0d3b281ca0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:25.300366+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}